Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.10,0:06:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不要啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Don't do it! Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.52,0:06:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,太残忍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}It's horrible!{\r}
