Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.17,0:06:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉老板 我们返程了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Tell the boss we're coming back home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.01,0:07:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,距离"侏罗纪世界"遭到摧毁已经过去了三年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Three years after the fall of Jurassic World,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.36,0:07:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,围绕着怒布拉岛的争论仍然十分激烈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}the debate over Isla Nublar rages on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.33,0:07:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,岛上长期休眠的火山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}The island's long-dormant volcano,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.54,0:07:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,已重新被归类为活火山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}reclassified as active,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.28,0:07:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,最近几个月来其活动明显增强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}has shown considerable unrest in recent months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.30,0:07:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,目前地理学家预测 地球上最后一批恐龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Geologists now predict an extinction-level event{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,将会迎来灭顶之灾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}will kill off the last living dinosaurs on the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,自从2015年那场震惊世界的灾难发生之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Since the disaster that shocked the world in 2015,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.64,0:07:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,马斯拉尼公司已经支付了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}the Masrani Corporation has paid out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.49,0:07:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,超过8亿元的赔偿金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}more than over 800 million in damages{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.70,0:07:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,用于处理事故幸存者提起的集体诉讼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}to settle class-action lawsuits brought by survivors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.91,0:07:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,世界各地的民间组织纷纷动员起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Activist groups have mobilized{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.71,0:07:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,在当代动物权益问题上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}around the globe in what has become{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.06,0:07:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,表达自己的立场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}the flashpoint animal rights issue of our time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.03,0:07:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,面对随时可能爆发的火山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}With an eruption expected at any moment,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.44,0:07:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,美国参议院成立了一个特别委员会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}the U.S. Senate has convened a special committee{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.18,0:07:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,讨论这个严肃的伦理问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}to answer a grave moral question:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.60,0:08:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是否该给予恐龙和其他频危物种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Do dinosaurs deserve the same protections{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.29,0:08:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,同样的保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}given to other endangered species,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,还是该任由它们灭绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}or should they be left to die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.89,0:08:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为 我们应该让这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I think that we should allow our, uh,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.27,0:08:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,曾令世人惊叹的恐龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}magnificent and glorious dinosaurs...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.66,0:08:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,随着火山爆发灭绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}to be taken out by the volcano.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.39,0:08:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这无异于谋杀犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Murderer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.23,0:08:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,请保持安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Silence, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.76,0:08:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然那样的结果令人痛心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}As... as deeply sad as that would be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.00,0:08:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们已经改变了大自然的进程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}we altered the course of natural history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.70,0:08:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这是纠正我们之前犯下的错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}This is a correction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.89,0:08:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你的意思是这场天灾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Are you suggesting the Almighty is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.16,0:08:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,其实是上帝的安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}taking matters in his own hands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.02,0:08:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,参议员先生 恕我直言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Senator, with all due respect, God's not part{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.16,0:08:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝并不是自然平衡体系的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}of the equation, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.07,0:08:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我想说的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}What I mean is that,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.23,0:08:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,过去一百年中 我们积累了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}in the last century, we amassed, uh,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,划时代的科技力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}landmark technological power,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.24,0:08:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,同时不断有例子证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}and we've consistently proven ourselves incapable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.74,0:08:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们无法掌控这种力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}of handling that power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.73,0:08:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,比如80年前 有谁能预料到核扩散的风险呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}80 years ago, who could have predicted nuclear proliferation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.64,0:08:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但这就是发生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}But then there it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.69,0:08:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 我们掌控了基因力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}And now we've got genetic power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.07,0:08:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这种力量扩散到全球又会花多少时间呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}So, how long is it gonna take for that to spread around the globe,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.72,0:08:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,人们又会用它做什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}and what's gonna be done with it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.05,0:09:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,人类不会止步于再生已经灭绝的恐龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}It aingt gonna stop with the de-extinction of the dinosaurs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不太明白你想表达什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Uh, I'm not sure I know what you're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我想说的是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I'm talking about...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.86,0:09:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,人为的 灾难性的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}man-made cataclysmic...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.98,0:09:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.00,0:09:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,什么样的改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}What kind of change?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.92,0:09:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,毁灭性的改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Change is like death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.21,0:09:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,只有大难临头 人类才会知道究竟要面对什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You don't know what it looks like until you're standing at the gates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.02,0:09:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上 我十分关心恐龙的利益\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}As a matter of fact, I do have the dinosaurs' best interests in mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.81,0:09:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是一个古生物兽医 - 真的存在这种职业吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- I'm a paleo-veterinarian. - Is that a real thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.77,0:09:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 你见过古生物吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- That's a real thing. - You've seen one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.28,0:09:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我没有亲眼见过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}No, I haven't seen one with my own eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.75,0:09:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不是谁都可以把毕生积蓄花在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You know, not everyone can afford to spend their life savings...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.39,0:09:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Claire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.09,0:09:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,您好…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Oh, uh, hello, hello, um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.80,0:10:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 国会议员德尔加多女士 - 国会议员德尔加多女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Congresswoman Delgado. - Congresswoman Delgado.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫克莱尔 是这个组织的负责人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I'm-I'm Claire. I'm the lead organizer here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.31,0:10:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题 但是我能占用你一点时间吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Uh, of course. But if I could just get a moment of your time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.25,0:10:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.03,0:10:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.31,0:10:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,恐龙保护组织的主要工作是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Um, so, our mission here at the Dinosaur Protection Group is to secure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.28,0:10:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,争取联邦资金…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}federal funding for a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.24,0:10:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚的电话保持了四十秒 你有进步啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}That was, like, 40 seconds. You're getting better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.35,0:10:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你别再让你妈妈在帮你买衣服了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You got to stop letting your mom shop for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.07,0:10:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你用不着每次有人惹你生气 就来羞辱我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You don't need to insult me every time someone pisses you off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.65,0:10:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟 我是医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Dude, I'm a doctor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.24,0:10:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不是电话推销员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}not a telemarketer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.44,0:10:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你是干什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}What is your job again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.98,0:10:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,接电线的 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You plug in cords, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.44,0:10:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你把我的工作想的太简单了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}It's actually more important than it sounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.32,0:10:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我能问你一个问题吗 - 请讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Can I ask you a question? - Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.69,0:10:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 您有孩子吗 - 两个女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Do you have kids? - Two girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.43,0:10:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 您的孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Okay. So, your kids,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.28,0:10:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们这代人都生活在一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}an entire generation, has grown up in a world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.65,0:10:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有真实恐龙存活的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}where dinosaurs are living and breathing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.55,0:10:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,但很快 他们就只能眼睁睁的看着这些恐龙灭绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}But soon they're gonna have to watch them go extinct...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.47,0:10:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,或者不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}or not,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.91,0:10:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有像您这样的人愿意伸出援手的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}If people like you make a difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.59,0:10:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,听证会结束后到我办公室来谈一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Set up a meeting with my office after the hearing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.34,0:10:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.11,0:10:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.53,0:10:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在直播国会…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We now go live to the Capitol...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.80,0:10:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔 开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Claire. It's on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 声音开大点 - 大点声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Hey, hey, turn it up. - Turn it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.22,0:11:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,发言将宣布美国政府是否会采取措施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Take preventative action{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.50,0:11:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,保护怒布拉岛上的恐龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}to protect the dinosaurs on Isla Nublar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.99,0:11:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,经过慎重的讨论 委员会作出决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}After a thorough deliberations, the committee has resolved{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.30,0:11:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不建议立法保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}not to recommend any legislative action{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.95,0:11:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,怒布拉岛上的再生灭绝动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}regarding the de-extinct creatures on Isla Nublar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.63,0:11:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,天命难违\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}This is an act of God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.21,0:11:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 我们对这些动物深表同情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}And while, of course, we feel great sympathy for these animals,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.84,0:11:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们不能容许政府部门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}we cannot condone government involvement{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.13,0:11:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,干预这一私有的商业项目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}on what amounts to a privately owned venture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.47,0:11:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,恐龙危在旦夕 却根本没人在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}They're all gonna die, and no one cares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.52,0:11:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,让我一个人静静 大家回去干活吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Give me one second. Let's get back to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.56,0:11:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 大家都别聊天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Okay, everyone, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.03,0:11:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.11,0:11:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,请问是迪尔林女士吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}May I speak with Ms. Dearing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.70,0:11:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是克莱尔·迪尔林 - 早上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Yes, this is Claire Dearing. - Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.71,0:11:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是本杰明·洛克伍德先生的宅邸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I'm calling from Mr. Benjamin Lockwood's estate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.01,0:11:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,您能稍等一会吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Would you mind holding for a second?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:11:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我会等着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Yes, of c... of course, I'll hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.73,0:12:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,迪尔林女士 您来的真早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Ms. Dearing, you're early.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.95,0:12:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,请进吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Would you like to step in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.31,0:12:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.01,0:12:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我去通知米尔斯先生您来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I will inform Mr. Mills that you've arrived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:13:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰·艾尔弗雷德·哈蒙德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}John Alfred Hammond,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.10,0:13:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,侏罗纪公园的创始人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}the father of Jurassic Park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.78,0:13:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,当然我不说你也知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}But of course, you know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.42,0:13:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 克莱尔 我是伊莱·米尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hello, Claire. I'm, uh, I'm Eli Mills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.51,0:13:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,本·洛克伍德是我的老板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I work for Ben Lockwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.39,0:13:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我们七八年前见过一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We actually met once, seven, eight years ago,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.46,0:13:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你应该不记得了 - 我当然记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- and you don't remember... - Of course I remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.74,0:13:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你接管他的基金会时…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Haven't you run his foundation since...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.09,0:13:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,还是个大学生 你还记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Since college, yeah. Y-You remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 真厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Yes. - Wow. Cool. He, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.81,0:13:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他想找个年轻且有理想的人管理他的财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}he wanted someone young and, uh, idealistic to spend his fortune...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.13,0:13:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,当年的我就是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}and I used to be both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.77,0:13:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,先跟你讲讲历史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Let me give you a bit of history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是一切开始的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}This is where it all began.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.43,0:13:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,在那些岛屿 索纳岛 侏罗纪公园所有这些出现之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Before the island, Sorna, Jurassic Park, all of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.68,0:13:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,哈蒙德和洛克伍德在我们脚下的地下室里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hammond and Lockwood built a custom lab{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.98,0:13:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,建立了实验室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}in the subbasement,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.31,0:13:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,从琥珀中首次提取了恐龙的DNA\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}extracted the first DNA from amber right beneath our feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.12,0:13:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Oh, my goodness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.19,0:13:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在这里所创造的一切就是个奇迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}What they did here was a miracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.34,0:13:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我始终这么认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I still believe that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.60,0:13:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,深有同感 克莱尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}So do I, Claire. So do I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.27,0:13:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我依然认为人类不该漠视这些动物的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}And I still believe it matters what happens to those animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.35,0:13:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,洛克伍德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}There is something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.54,0:13:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,想拜托你一件事 克莱尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Mr. Lockwood would very much like you to do, Claire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.50,0:14:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你就当是帮老朋友一个忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You can call it a favor for an old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.17,0:14:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有一块土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We have a piece of land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.63,0:14:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,周围有天然屏障保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}A sanctuary protected by natural barriers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.62,0:14:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,并且能自给自足的保护区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}fully self-sustaining.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.19,0:14:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,恐龙可以在这个新家 安全自由的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}A new home where the dinosaurs will be secure and free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.00,0:14:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你要把它们救出来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You're gonna get them out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.79,0:14:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,拯救它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You're gonna save them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.14,0:14:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不 迪尔林小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}No, Ms. Dearing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.99,0:14:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,获得拯救的是我们自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I'm going to save us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都希望得到点救赎 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We could both use a touch of redemption, couldn't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.02,0:14:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴又见面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Lovely to see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.24,0:14:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是 洛克伍德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}And you, Mr. Lockwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.48,0:14:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这是约翰·哈蒙德的梦想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}This was all John Hammond's dream,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.40,0:14:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,让这些动物平静的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}to let these creatures live in peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.06,0:14:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们建立了这片保护区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}So we have created sanctuary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.80,0:14:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,没有围栏 没有笼子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}No fences, no cages,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.09,0:14:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没有游客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}no tourists...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.77,0:14:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,还原大自然母亲的面貌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}just as Mother Nature intended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.43,0:14:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰有句话说的很对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}John said it best:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.06,0:14:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,"这些生物不需要我们的保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}"These creatures don't need our protection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.27,0:14:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,它们需要的是 不受打扰"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}They need our absence."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.90,0:14:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我和约翰年轻的时候都是满腔热血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}When we were young, we both shared this passion, John and I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.10,0:15:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们两个当时多幼稚啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}What fools we were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.42,0:15:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,还没学会走路就想跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Trying to run before we'd learned to walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.71,0:15:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这应该就是年轻人的通病吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}As all young men do, I suppose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.74,0:15:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们还是取得了成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}But... we learned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.48,0:15:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜的是 最终我们分道扬镳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Unfortunately, in the end, it drove us apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.47,0:15:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,生活给我们带来的教训有时是非常惨痛的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Life teaches us some very hard lessons,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.28,0:15:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗 克莱尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}doesn't it, Claire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.40,0:15:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.72,0:15:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,本杰明爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Sir Benjamin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.02,0:15:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,又得吃那些药了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Ah. My bloody medicines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.21,0:15:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,恕我失陪 克莱尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Will you excuse me, Claire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.92,0:15:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,您请便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.18,0:15:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,伊莱会告诉你具体事宜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Eli here will help you with the details.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.58,0:15:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会把它们救出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We will save them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.94,0:15:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是我们留给…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}What a gift...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.70,0:15:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,后代的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}for our children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.72,0:15:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.90,0:15:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Iris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.75,0:16:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他有孩子吗 我刚看见了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Does he have children? I-I thought I saw...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.74,0:16:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一个小女孩 - 他有一个外孙女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Was there a little girl... - Uh, he has a grandchild.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.80,0:16:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他女儿出车祸去世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}He's, uh, his daughter died in a car accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.08,0:16:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太不幸了 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- That's awful. - Yeah, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.51,0:16:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好在他们祖孙俩感情很好 非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}But they're very close. Really close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.33,0:16:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你们需要我做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}So what do you need from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.43,0:16:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,当时公园里部署了一套追踪系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}There was a tracking system in place at your park...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.28,0:16:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,每只恐龙体内都植入了无线电识别芯片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}radio-frequency ID chips in each dinosaur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.53,0:16:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我记得 - 对 只要我们能进入那套追踪系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- I remember. - Right. So if we could access that system,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.35,0:16:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们定位和安全捕捉他们的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}our ability to locate and capture those animals safely{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.58,0:16:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,就能大大提升\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}would increase tenfold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.99,0:16:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们访问那个系统需要你的掌纹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We need your handprint to access the system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,但我真正需要的 克莱尔…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}But what I really need, Claire...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.41,0:16:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}is you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.40,0:16:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,迁移濒危物种严格来说不是合法的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Moving endangered species isn't exactly legal,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.14,0:16:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们这么做是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}but it's the right thing to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.66,0:16:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,没人比你更了解那座公园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}No one knows this park as well as you do,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.35,0:16:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要你的专业能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}and we need that expertise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们能救出多少物种 - 至少十一个物种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- How many can you save? - 11 species, for sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.32,0:16:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也想多救一些 但时间不允许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I mean, more if we can... but time is against us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,其中有一只恐龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I'm afraid there is one animal in particular{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.87,0:16:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,对于我们来说十分棘手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}that poses a real challenge for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.30,0:16:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 布鲁 - 我都不知道她还有名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Blue. - I didn't know she had a name,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.00,0:16:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁很有可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}but Blue is potentially{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.55,0:17:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是地球上智慧水平第二高的生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}the second most intelligent piece of life on this planet,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.67,0:17:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,同时她也是此物种的最后一只了 必须保护好她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}and she's the last of her kind. She must be preserved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.69,0:17:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,她在一英里之外就能闻到你的气味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}She can pick up your scent a mile off...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.61,0:17:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你抓不住她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}you'll never capture her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.36,0:17:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.21,0:17:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们觉得你可能认识一位能帮上忙的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}we thought you might know someone who could help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你能说服他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Maybe you could convince him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.41,0:17:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 欧文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey, Owen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.85,0:18:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,欧文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Owen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.96,0:18:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Oh, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.48,0:18:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.87,0:18:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,又来找事了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Back for more, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.16,0:18:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我请你喝杯酒吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Can I buy you a beer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.64,0:18:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你是把酒带来了 还是我们要去别的地方喝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Did you bring 'em, or do we gotta, like, go somewhere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.83,0:18:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 不是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I'm sorry. Seriously?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.64,0:18:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信你居然觉得是你甩了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I can't believe you think that you left me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.08,0:18:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来回忆一下当时的对话 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Replay the conversation in your head, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.78,0:18:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你说 "你想跟流浪汉一样住在货车里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You said, "You wanna go live in your van like a bum?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.74,0:18:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,请便吧 欧文"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Go ahead, Owen."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.43,0:18:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我说 "好啊"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}And I said, "Okay."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.23,0:18:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这怎么叫你甩了我 - 因为我走了 我离开了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- So how is that you leaving me? - Because I left. I left you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.48,0:18:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是我叫你走 你才走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You left because I told you to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.39,0:18:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,结果还是 我走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}And then I left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.65,0:18:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你不想住在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Because you didn't wanna live in a van{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.20,0:18:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 路边的货车里 记得吗 - 不不不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- on the side of the road, remember? - No. No, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.00,0:18:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为你不让我开那破车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Because you wouldn't let me drive the damn van{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:18:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 五分钟都不行 - 我那叫绅士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- for five minutes. - I'm chivalrous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:18:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不然你要我怎么办 - 你这叫顽固\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- What can I do? - You are so stubborn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.32,0:19:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你现在的样子 你在拯救世界呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Well, look at you now. You're saving the world, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.31,0:19:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,至少我在努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Well, I'm trying at least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.26,0:19:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能总是遇到问题就逃避 欧文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You can't just run away from everything, Owen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.63,0:19:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你现在状况如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}So you're what...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.13,0:19:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是在跟哪个会计约会吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}dating an accountant now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.12,0:19:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,还是保险精算师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}An insurance actuary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.71,0:19:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你的皮肤看起来很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Your skin looks nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.78,0:19:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是皮肤科医生吗 - 欧文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Dermatologist? - Owen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.02,0:19:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他会检查你皮肤上的痣吗 - 别说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Does he check you for moles? - Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.77,0:19:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是腹语师吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Ventriloquist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.79,0:19:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是来这讨论这个的 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}This is not why we're here, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.49,0:19:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你来干嘛的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Yeah, I know why we're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.83,0:19:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,洛克伍德的小跟班找过我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Lockwood's little flunky called me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.24,0:19:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,谈了那个救援行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Rescue Op.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.32,0:19:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,要把恐龙从快要爆炸的岛上救出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Save the dinosaurs from an island that's about to explode...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.46,0:19:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那能出什么岔子呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}what could go wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.61,0:19:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要去 - 别去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- I'm going. - Don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.82,0:19:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我别无选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I don't have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.09,0:19:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,瞎说 你当然有选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}What? Of course you have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.76,0:19:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不然呢 我要怎么办 整天造小屋 打台球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}So what, I should just... build my own cabin, play pool,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.55,0:19:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,喝喝啤酒 眼睁睁看着那些恐龙全部灭绝吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}and drink beer all day while these dinosaurs go extinct?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.69,0:19:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.88,0:19:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我就喜欢打台球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I like pool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.82,0:19:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Blue is alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.93,0:19:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 克莱尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Jesus, Claire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.02,0:19:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你亲手养大了她 欧文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You raised her, Owen. You...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.92,0:19:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你花了那么多年研究她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}you spent years of your life working with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.98,0:19:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你舍得看她死在岛上吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You're just gonna let her die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.96,0:19:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,舍得啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Well, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.21,0:20:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 你比你自己认为的更善良\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Come on, you're a better man than... you think you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.37,0:20:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该去写幸运饼干里的小纸条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You should write fortune cookies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.56,0:20:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Forget it, I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.34,0:20:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,包机明天早上出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}There's a charter flight leaving tomorrow morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.68,0:20:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,旅客名单上有你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You're on the manifest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.96,0:20:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是过来告诉你一声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I just wanted to let you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.64,0:20:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 进食时间到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}All right, chow time, chow time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.29,0:20:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,退后 退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Back up. Back off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.40,0:20:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,悠着点 艾可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Take it easy. Echo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.63,0:20:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 东西够吃不用抢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Geez. There's plenty of food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.64,0:20:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你们今天是吃糖了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}God, you guys been eating sugar or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.34,0:20:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一个个都这么活跃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You're hyper today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.79,0:20:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Okay, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.42,0:20:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,退后 谢谢 布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Back up. Thank you, Blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.35,0:21:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你拍下来了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Did you get that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.20,0:21:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,放松点 你骑马摔死的几率比坐飞机高多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Relax. You're more likely to die riding on a horse than in a plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.91,0:21:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能 我压根不会去骑马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}No, I'm not, because I won't get on a horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.94,0:21:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 摔死的可能性为零 - 飞机是最安全的交通工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- My chances are zero. - Planes are the safest way to travel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.48,0:21:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这也能叫飞机 我表弟的无人机都比这个大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You call this a plane? My cousin has a drone bigger than this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.02,0:21:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,欧文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Owen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.94,0:21:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,富兰克林 你个胆小鬼 快上飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Franklin, you wiener, get on the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.84,0:21:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为你不会来了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Didn't think you were gonna ever show up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.21,0:21:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这位是齐娅·罗德里格兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Oh, um, this is Zia Rodriguez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.83,0:21:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 齐娅 - 嘿 你好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Zia. - Hey. How you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.45,0:21:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很好 你呢 - 我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Yeah. Real good. How are you? - Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.35,0:21:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这位是富兰克林·韦伯 系统分析员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Franklin Webb. Systems analyst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.85,0:21:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你害怕坐飞机吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Nervous flyer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.20,0:21:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,给你一匹九百多斤重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Would you ride{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.02,0:21:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,常年遭到虐待的马 你敢骑吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}a thousand-pound horse that's been abused all its life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.92,0:22:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾经着骑摩托 跟一群迅猛龙穿越丛林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I rode my motorcycle through the jungle with a pack of raptors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.70,0:22:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你八字不合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We're not compatible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.72,0:22:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,梅茜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Maisie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.67,0:22:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你总是躲躲藏藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You're always hiding from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.05,0:22:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我的工作可不是天天找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}This is not my job, looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.84,0:22:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,梅茜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Maisie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.23,0:22:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,梅茜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Maisie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.31,0:22:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,快出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Come out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.28,0:22:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,臭丫头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Oh! You silly sausage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.94,0:22:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你要吓死我啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You'll be the death of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.05,0:22:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哪天我真的被你吓死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You know, one day my heart might really stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.64,0:22:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你要怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Then what would you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.08,0:22:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,去森林里跟狮子一起住吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Go and live in the forest with the lions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.65,0:22:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,森林里没有狮子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}There are no lions in the forest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.14,0:22:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你外公找你好久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Your grandfather's been asking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.63,0:23:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 快去找你外公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Really? - Mm-hmm. So you go see your grandfather,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.60,0:23:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 然后马上去洗澡 - 我不想洗澡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- and then you go straight to your bath. - I don't want a bath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.07,0:23:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么 姑娘 要注意发音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}A what? Queen's English, girl. "Bath"!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.02,0:23:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 洗澡 - 洗澡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Bath. Bath. - Bath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.24,0:23:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是洗澡 不是"洗找"你可不是野兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Bath, not "bath." You're not a wild animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.72,0:23:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,别闹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.04,0:23:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 外公 - 你来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Hi, Grandpa. - Ah, there you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.72,0:23:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,过来 陪我坐会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Come over and sit by me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.69,0:23:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我想你了 - 我去游猎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- I've missed you. - I was on safari all the way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.12,0:23:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,一天之内我从白垩纪游历到了侏罗纪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}through the Cretaceous to the Jurassic in one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.53,0:23:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 厉害 你都看到了什么 - 大部分都是食草动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Oh, my. What'd you see? - Mostly herbivores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.55,0:23:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我见到了一只霸王龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}There was one T. rex, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.48,0:23:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,场面一度很血腥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Casualties, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.20,0:23:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,艾莉丝也遭殃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Iris included.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.60,0:23:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,她都吓得魂飞魄散了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}She jumped out of her skin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.56,0:23:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟你妈妈一样古灵精怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You have your mother's wicked sense of humor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.00,0:23:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我长得像她吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Do I look like her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.21,0:23:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.53,0:23:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你简直就是她的翻版\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You could be her mirror image.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.20,0:23:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈去过那座公园吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Did my mother ever visit the park?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.88,0:23:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,去过一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Once...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.23,0:24:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,很多年前了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}a long time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.56,0:24:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,如果她在的话 也一定会去救它们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}She would have saved them, too, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.86,0:24:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,她会把它们全部都救出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}She would have saved them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.85,0:25:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Claire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.12,0:25:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我是肯·惠特利 欢迎回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Ken Wheatley. Welcome back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.09,0:25:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到救援行动规模这么大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Quite an operation you've got going on here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.00,0:25:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,洛克伍德先生十分重视此次人道主义行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Mr. Lockwood takes his humanitarian efforts very seriously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.67,0:25:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那个"迅猛龙牛仔"在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Where's the, uh, raptor wrangler?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.85,0:25:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是动物行为专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Animal behaviorist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.43,0:25:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 欧文·格瑞帝 - 欧文 我是肯·惠特利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Owen Grady. - Hey, Owen. Ken Wheatley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.76,0:25:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你是传说中的"白人猎手"吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}And you are... Great White Hunter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.08,0:25:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,算是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.04,0:25:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我是探险指导专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I'm the expedition facilitator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.36,0:25:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 热死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Oh, God! It's hot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.53,0:25:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,很快会热的更夸张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}It's about to get a whole lot hotter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.79,0:25:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,继续走 可以通过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Keep it moving! You're all clear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.90,0:25:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,继续走 你们可以通过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Go! Go, you've got the green light!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.53,0:25:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这边 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}This way, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.25,0:25:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,继续走 往前开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Let's go! Keep it moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.88,0:25:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,停一停 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hold it! Hold up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.67,0:26:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,驱蚊喷雾要吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Need some bug spray?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.42,0:26:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你要吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Bug spray?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.25,0:26:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,霸王龙已经死了 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}The T. rex would be dead by now, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.24,0:26:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不一定 如果生存环境彻底改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}No. It's impossible to know the max lifespan of a clone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.84,0:26:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就无法估算克隆生物的寿命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}in a completely different environment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.96,0:26:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,比如洞穴人只能活二十年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Take a caveman that would have lived 20 years,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.08,0:26:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,给他吃好的 给他看医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}feed him prime meals, give him health care,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.17,0:26:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他的寿命就能翻五倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}he's gonna live... five times as long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.56,0:26:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,所以霸王龙已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}So she'd be dead by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.84,0:26:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.59,0:27:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,想起不好的往事了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Bad memories?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.21,0:27:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,也有美好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Some were good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.88,0:27:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.25,0:27:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是霸王龙吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Is it the T. rex?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.90,0:27:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得近点看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I have to see this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.43,0:27:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey. Miss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.53,0:27:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Miss!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.98,0:27:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那片区域不安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}This area's not secured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.09,0:28:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.23,0:28:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,想不到我居然能亲眼看到恐龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Never thought I'd see one in real life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.02,0:28:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,她真漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}She's beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.10,0:28:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可以走了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Can we...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.15,0:29:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 下车吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Okay, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.28,0:29:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Okay, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.03,0:29:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,找到主系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Okay, main system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.34,0:29:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,启动控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Turn on control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.10,0:29:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,应该能行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}It should be working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.63,0:29:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 猛男\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Come on, tiger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.93,0:29:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底行不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You know what you're doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.12,0:29:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你先请 猛男\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}After you, tiger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.71,0:29:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能确定这些生物芯片还有信号吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Are we sure these biometric chips are still transmitting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.37,0:29:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,普通电池应该早没电了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Battery would be dead by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.03,0:29:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 恐龙自身就是电源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- All right. - The dinosaur is the battery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.70,0:29:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,体温和运动会转化为电能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}They're powered by body heat and movement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.42,0:29:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.93,0:29:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,需要多久才能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}How much longer until...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.48,0:29:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,进去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I'm in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.32,0:30:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,有大量信号聚集在东部码头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}There's a large concentration on the east dock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.19,0:30:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我们的船 我们已经抓到了一大批\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}That's our boat... we've already captured a bunch of 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.72,0:30:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不需要靠追踪系统吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Without the tracking system?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.64,0:30:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,大型食草动物很好找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}The big herbivores are easy to find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.55,0:30:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,能单独显示那只迅猛龙吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Can you isolate that raptor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.10,0:30:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我需要物种代码 - D-9\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- I need a species code. - D-nine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.94,0:30:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,她在那 我要借用一下你的卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}There she is. I'm gonna need to borrow your truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.99,0:30:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你一块去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I'm coming with you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.30,0:30:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定她会需要接受治疗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}we don't know what kind of condition she might be in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.20,0:30:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,小姐 外面可不安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Miss, things could get hairy out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.07,0:30:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这种镇静剂的药性很强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}These are powerful sedatives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.72,0:30:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,用量过大可能会造成呼吸衰竭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}One too many, and she could have respiratory failure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.01,0:30:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 我没你想的那么柔弱无知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Also, I'm not as soft and witless as your comment implies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.44,0:30:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,出发吧 大块头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Let's go, beefcake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.86,0:30:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,欧文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Oh, Owen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.54,0:30:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Be careful, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.81,0:30:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我没能活着回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}If I don't make it back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.09,0:30:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,要记住…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}remember...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.73,0:30:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是你叫我来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}you're the one who made me come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.55,0:30:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I'll be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.05,0:31:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们开着车是没法靠近她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We're not gonna get any closer to her in this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.14,0:31:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在这停车 - 停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- We should stop here. - Hold up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.17,0:31:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,保持警惕 注意安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Load out, look alive, stay alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.60,0:31:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们会保护你的 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- We got your back, brother. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.93,0:31:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔 我得一个人去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Claire, I'm gonna have to track her alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.83,0:31:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你帮我留意她的动向 明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I'll need you to be my eyes if she runs. Copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.32,0:31:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Copy that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.68,0:32:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,惠特利 我找到了新鲜的痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Wheatley, I'm on fresh sign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.60,0:32:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,等我的信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Wait for my signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.16,0:32:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,找到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}There you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.34,0:32:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 小妞 你想我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey, girl. You miss me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.82,0:32:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Easy. Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.03,0:32:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.30,0:32:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你带了好东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I brought you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.62,0:33:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.58,0:33:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.88,0:33:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.90,0:33:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You know me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.36,0:33:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Eyes on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.28,0:33:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.14,0:33:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.77,0:33:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.38,0:33:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You know me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.34,0:33:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.43,0:33:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.60,0:33:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,别开枪…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hold your...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.08,0:33:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫你们等我信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I told you to wait for my signal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.37,0:33:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,叫你的人立刻后退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Back your men up right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.90,0:34:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不 等等 别向她开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}No, hey, no, no, don't shoot her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.33,0:34:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,惠利特 你这个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Wheatley, you son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.21,0:34:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,欧文 你们这是干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Owen! What are you doing?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.75,0:34:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,欧文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Owen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.26,0:34:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我要是死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You shoot me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.32,0:34:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那只恐龙也活不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}and that animal dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.87,0:34:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在没有条件威胁我们 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I think we have the drop on you, sweetheart.{\r}
