Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.86,0:45:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,深吸一口气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Take a deep breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.96,0:46:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 齐娅呢 - 我们被骗了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Where is Zia? - It was a double-cross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.95,0:46:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,她被带走了 她和布鲁一起被带了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}They took her. She must be with Blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.62,0:46:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在还能追踪他们吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey, can you still track 'em?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.60,0:47:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Not anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.49,0:47:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,都是骗人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}It was a lie. It was a lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.03,0:47:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋 全是骗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Bastards! It was all a lie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.75,0:47:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,也不全是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Not all of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.99,0:47:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Move it! Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.92,0:47:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,值钱的东西 全都给我装上船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Anything of value, I want on that boat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.63,0:47:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你那边怎么样了 - 螺栓没法固定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- How you doing?! - The bolt won't give!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.67,0:47:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那就捆好了 整个搬走 动作快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Well, just button it up, and we'll tow it on! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.67,0:47:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Come on, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.76,0:48:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey! Hey, hey, hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.20,0:48:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hang on! Wait up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.10,0:48:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,让这辆车停下 停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Stop that truck! Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.11,0:48:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 亲爱的 你好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey, sweetheart. Hello, hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.76,0:48:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,真不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.29,0:48:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,等你清醒了之后 才会知道疼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You're gonna feel that when you wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.81,0:48:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 把枪放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey, put your weapon down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.32,0:48:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,别用枪管指着她的头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You got the barrel pointed right at her head!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.63,0:48:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 惠特利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey, Wheatley!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.92,0:48:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,齐娅在他们手上 他们在撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}They have Zia. They're loading out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.61,0:48:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都抓到恐龙了 还叫我们来干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}If they already had the dinosaurs, why do they need us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.53,0:48:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他们需要借助追踪系统抓布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}They needed the tracking system to capture Blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.84,0:48:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,她在那 看样子不太好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}There she is. She don't look good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.10,0:48:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得上那条船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We need to get on that boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.77,0:48:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们在岩石后面挺安全的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}The rock's good. We're safe on the rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.39,0:48:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,船还是岩浆 你选一个 富兰克林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}It's the boat or the lava, Franklin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.52,0:49:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 船不错 我选船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}All right, boat's good. I'm all about the boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.89,0:49:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,动作快 上船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Go, go, get on the boat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.80,0:49:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,上船 动作快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Get on the boat now! Go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.51,0:49:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 跑起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Move it, move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.74,0:49:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,去卡车那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Get that truck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.58,0:49:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,富兰克林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Franklin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.28,0:49:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快去把车子发动起来 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Hey, get that truck going! - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.74,0:49:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没事吧 - 我死了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- You okay? - Am I dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.05,0:49:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,还没有 小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Not yet, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.30,0:49:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.43,0:49:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.34,0:49:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,快来把手给我 加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Give me your hand! Reach!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.43,0:49:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Come on, reach!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.80,0:50:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.90,0:52:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,米尔斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Mr. Mills?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.91,0:52:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,有位客户在等您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Your visitor's waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.10,0:52:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,艾威索先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Mr. Eversoll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.07,0:52:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,终于有幸见到你本人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}It's a pleasure to meet you in person after all this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.23,0:52:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好吗 - 请问一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- How are ya? - Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.39,0:52:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是 - 恐龙在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Yeah. - Where are the dinosaurs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.75,0:52:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,恐龙在路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}The dinosaurs are, uh, are en route.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.24,0:52:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你准备让我拿这些标本去拍卖吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Oh, so am I supposed to sell these ones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.46,0:52:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这一点你不用担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Look, you don't need to worry, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.97,0:52:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,它们很快就到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}They will be here soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.97,0:52:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢跟外行人做生意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I-I don't really work with amateurs,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.34,0:52:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我会通知买家 取消这次会面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}so I'm gonna contact my buyers and call this off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.81,0:52:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,它们明天就到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}They will be here tomorrow,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.87,0:52:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会让你的买家失望的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}and your buyers won't be disappointed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.42,0:52:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 不管他们想用于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Trust me, whatever their interest...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.84,0:52:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,农业 工业还是狩猎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}agricultural, industrial, sport hunting...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.07,0:52:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都能满足他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}we will have something to suit them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.81,0:52:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,十一种恐龙 每种都有独一无二的生物医药价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}11 species, each with unique biopharmaceutical properties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.34,0:52:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我预估每种可值四百万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I estimate four million per species.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.28,0:53:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,四百万对于我们这行的人来说只是小钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Four million is a slow Tuesday where I'm from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.47,0:53:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我在浪费我的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You're wasting my time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.84,0:53:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,一亿对你来说也是小钱吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You ever made a hundred million on a Tuesday?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.76,0:53:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这些都是陈年旧事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}All this is in the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.56,0:53:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我想跟你谈的是未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I want to talk to you about the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.95,0:53:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你十分钟时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I'll give you ten minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.96,0:53:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,拍卖怒布拉岛上的恐龙主要是为了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}The whole point of selling the Isla Nublar dinosaurs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.96,0:53:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,给这里研发未来的业务筹集资金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}is to finance our future operations here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.52,0:53:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这是种子基金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}It's, uh, seed money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.70,0:53:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是试水 后面还有更有野心的目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Call it a-an overture to something much more ambitious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.88,0:53:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我猜还有更大的利润\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Yeah, and more lucrative, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.38,0:53:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 我们启用了原有的设施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Right. We've reactivated the old facilities,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.28,0:53:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,对技术进行了升级\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}updated the technology,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.63,0:53:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,并招募了一批全球顶尖的遗传学专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}and imported the best geneticists from around the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.28,0:53:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这个项目已经筹备多年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}This operation has been many years in the planning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.72,0:53:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,基因是一片尚待开发的新领域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Genetic power is an uncharted frontier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.89,0:53:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,它的发展潜力远远超乎你的想象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}The potential for growth is more than you can fathom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.87,0:53:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这边请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}This way, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.29,0:53:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,如果说这段令人唏嘘的历史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}If the entire run of our sorry history{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.75,0:53:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,使我们明白了一个亘古不变的事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}has taught us one irrevocable lesson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.03,0:54:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是战争对人类而言无法避免\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}it's that man is inevitably drawn to war{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.36,0:54:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,人们愿意用尽一切手段 只为赢得胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}and is willing to use any means necessary to win it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.39,0:54:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算把它们变成武器吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You're gonna weaponize them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.95,0:54:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,人类利用动物打仗已有数百年历史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We've been using animals in combat for centuries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.27,0:54:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,马 大象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Horses, elephants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.11,0:54:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,苏联人在斯大林格勒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}The Soviets used disease-bearing rats{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.05,0:54:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 利用老鼠携带的病毒对付德国人 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- against the Germans at Stalingrad. - Yes, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.49,0:54:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的遗传学家 已经创造出了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Our geneticists have created{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.32,0:54:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,亨利·吴的杰作的直系后代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}a direct descendant of Henry Wu's masterpiece,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.43,0:54:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是那只摧毁侏罗纪世界的野兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}the animal that took down Jurassic World.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.62,0:54:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,暴虐霸王龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Indominus rex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.01,0:54:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,在火山爆发之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Her DNA, retrieved from the island{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.27,0:54:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就从岛上取得了她的DNA\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}way before its destruction, forms the architecture{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.20,0:54:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,为此创造出了一个新的生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}of a completely new creature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.91,0:54:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,每块骨骼和肌肉都是为了狩猎和杀戮而设计的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Every bone and muscle designed for hunting and killing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.69,0:54:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏了欧文·格雷迪的研究\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}And thanks to Owen Grady's research,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.96,0:54:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,她会完全服从人类的指令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}it follows human command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.60,0:54:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们叫它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We call it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.92,0:54:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,暴虐迅猛龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}the Indoraptor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.06,0:54:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,外公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Grandpa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.33,0:54:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,外公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Grandpa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.62,0:55:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,外公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Grandpa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.02,0:55:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,梅茜 你怎么还没睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Maisie? What are you doing up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.23,0:55:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,今天有个男人来找米尔斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}There was a man here today with Mr. Mills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.95,0:55:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是来找他谈保护区的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}It was probably just some business about the sanctuary,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.10,0:55:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这没什么 - 我听到他们说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- that's all. - I heard them talking...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.92,0:55:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要把恐龙卖掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}they're going to sell the dinosaurs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.56,0:55:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,然后把它们运到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}They're bringing them here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.78,0:55:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定是听错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I'm sure you misunderstood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.48,0:55:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我绝对没有听错 - 梅茜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- I know what I heard, Grandpa. - Maisie,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.32,0:55:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,已经很晚了 你该睡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}it's way past your bedtime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.99,0:55:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事我们明天早上再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Let's talk about this in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.74,0:55:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可是… - 梅茜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- But... - Maisie,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.13,0:55:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我明天会查清楚的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I'll find out tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.91,0:55:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,快去睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Go to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.18,0:55:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.13,0:55:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安 宝贝儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Good night, my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.28,0:56:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Oh! Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.54,0:56:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 再坚持一会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}It's okay, Blue. Just a little longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.36,0:56:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 你们还活着…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Oh, my God! You guys are alive! You...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.61,0:56:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他们居然把她伤成这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Oh, look what they've done to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.75,0:56:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这群混蛋是什么人 - 动物走私犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Who are these assholes? - Animal traffickers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.27,0:56:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,看他们是怎么对这些恐龙的 他们才不会送它们去保护区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Look how they're treating them. They're not gonna take 'em to a sanctuary,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.40,0:56:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要卖掉它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}they're gonna sell them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.30,0:56:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,除了布鲁 他们要她还有别的用处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Not Blue. They need her for something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.21,0:56:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,什么用处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Like what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.31,0:56:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 但她…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I don't know, but she's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.93,0:56:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,她在流血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}she's hemorrhaging,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.81,0:56:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,而我没有医疗工具维持她的生命体征\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}and I don't have instruments, and they want to keep her alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.80,0:56:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You're all right. You're all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.10,0:56:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Claire, come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.94,0:56:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,用手按住这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Come on. Put your hand here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.56,0:56:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,用力按住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Steady pressure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.91,0:56:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey, hey, hey. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.28,0:57:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Watch out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.19,0:57:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要同样动物的血样来给她输血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I can't take the bullet out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.72,0:57:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我没法取出子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}without a transfusion from another animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.38,0:57:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你们谁知道怎么找静脉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Which one of you knows how to find a vein?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.20,0:57:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我在红十字会当过志愿者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Oh. I-I did a blood drive for the Red Cross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.31,0:57:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.60,0:57:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,富兰克林 你过来代替克莱尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Okay. Franklin, take over for Claire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.68,0:57:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我不行 不行 不行…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}No, no, no, no, no, no...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.16,0:57:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,富兰克林 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Franklin. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.60,0:57:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,用力按住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Steady pressure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.68,0:57:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Oh, my God. Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.64,0:57:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我嘴里有吗 溅到我嘴里了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Is it in my mouth? Did it get in my mouth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.33,0:57:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 确定？- 你没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- You sure? - You're good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.51,0:57:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,所有动物应该都打了镇静剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}All of the animals should be sedated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.23,0:57:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,找到坚尾龙类恐龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Look for any kind of tetanuran.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.48,0:57:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,它们的血型应该跟布鲁相似\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Their blood type should be close enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.30,0:57:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,要找有两个或三个脚趾的食肉类恐龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Look for carnivores with two or three fingers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.22,0:57:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不要超过三根脚趾的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}No more than three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.49,0:57:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我想船上应该就有一只\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I think there's one on board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.32,0:57:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You got to be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.73,0:58:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,镇静剂药效还在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}She's tranqued.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.56,0:58:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Okay, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.61,0:58:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我准备好了 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Okay, I got it. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.21,0:58:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.04,0:58:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.35,0:58:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.84,0:58:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.70,0:58:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你来抽血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You're gonna have to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.76,0:58:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我不行 她的皮太厚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I can't, I... the skin is too thick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.44,0:58:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我得用两只手才能给静脉施压\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I have to use both my hands to put pressure on the vein.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.68,0:58:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你来抽血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You got to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.73,0:58:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 我够不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I-I can't. I can't reach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.39,0:58:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你爬到背上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You're gonna have to climb up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.69,0:58:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Oh, I'm not...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.76,0:58:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不会爬到她背上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}No, no. I'm not gonna climb up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.01,0:58:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 跟骑牛没什么两样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You'll be okay. It's like riding a bull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.02,0:58:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,骑牛 你当我跟你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}"Riding a bull"? I didn't grow up in a rodeo{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.11,0:58:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是在竞技场混的吗 - 她现在没醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- or wherever you came from. - She's asleep now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.87,0:59:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不代表她待会不会醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I can't say that she's gonna be asleep a minute from now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.32,0:59:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}so get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.19,0:59:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Okay, fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.33,0:59:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 她可真臭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Oh, my God, she stinks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.03,0:59:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.46,0:59:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,慢点 慢点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Gently. Gently!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.48,0:59:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Good job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.94,0:59:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这画面毫无违和感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You're making this look totally normal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.67,0:59:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你得用力才能扎进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You're gonna have to jam it in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.48,0:59:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,她的皮很厚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}It's really thick skin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.32,0:59:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗 - 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Ready? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.45,0:59:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 一 - 一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Okay. One... - One...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.95,0:59:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 二 - 二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Two... - Two...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.25,0:59:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,扎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Stab!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.83,0:59:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 欧文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Oh, shoot. - Owen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.68,0:59:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}It's working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.65,0:59:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,门没关上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}That door is open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.08,0:59:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我来关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.29,1:00:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,栅栏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}The bars!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.12,1:00:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,栅栏 欧文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}The bars, Owen. Owen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.62,1:00:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我能从上面出去 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I can get through there. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.76,1:00:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,快跳 欧文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Jump, Owen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.56,1:00:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,欧文 跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Owen, jump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.11,1:00:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.65,1:00:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧见我敏捷的身手了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Did you see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.28,1:00:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,血袋你没忘记拿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Please tell me you got the blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.55,1:02:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这是德尔塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}This is Delta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.46,1:02:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,她是四只兽脚恐龙之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}She's one of the holdover theropods,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.09,1:02:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,第二组的幸存者之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}one of the survivors from the second group.{\r}
