Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.47,1:08:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,别傻站着了 快跟我走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Now get moving. Come on, follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.92,1:08:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Come on, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.95,1:08:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 还有很多事要做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Shit. - There's lots to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.04,1:08:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点 快点 - 糟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Get a move on, come on. - Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.27,1:08:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他会被识破的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}He's not gonna make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.63,1:08:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点 快点 - 我们得帮帮他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Move it! Come on, move! - We have to help him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.68,1:08:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你待在这儿 我去救他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Stay here. I'll get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.68,1:08:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,来不及了 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}There's no time. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.97,1:08:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,可以了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Good to go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.33,1:08:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Roll out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.94,1:08:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要把恐龙运去哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Where are they taking them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.69,1:08:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,很快就知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We're about to find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.08,1:08:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.36,1:08:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,撑住 姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Come on, girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.71,1:09:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.54,1:09:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是洛克庄园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}This is Lockwood's estate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.12,1:09:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他的车库肯定很大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}He must have one big-ass garage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.04,1:09:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 十分钟内完成卸货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Come on! We want this offloaded in ten mikes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.60,1:09:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,电他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hit him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.50,1:10:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为自己能瞒天过海吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Did you really think you could get away with it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.81,1:10:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,在我的眼皮底下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}In my own house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.37,1:10:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是你托付我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You entrusted me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.78,1:10:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,要带着你的财富走向未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}to guide your fortune into the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.43,1:10:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I have done that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.30,1:10:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,混账\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Damn you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.22,1:10:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,去拿电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Pick up that phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.94,1:10:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你向警方自首\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I want you to call the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.70,1:10:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好还是自己坦白吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}It'll be easier if the story comes from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.69,1:10:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,如你所愿 爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}As you say, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.62,1:10:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在想 约翰·哈蒙德是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You know, I've been thinking, John Hammond was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.23,1:10:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你的所作所为确实有违天理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}It was an unholy thing that you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.00,1:10:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿有罪的人不止我一个 你说呢 爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I'm not the only guilty one here, am I, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.11,1:11:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.35,1:11:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去镇上通知执法部门来阻止他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We hit that town, we call the cavalry, shut this down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.61,1:11:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.95,1:11:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你们应该乖乖留在岛上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You should have stayed on the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.28,1:11:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那样也许还能活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Better odds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.82,1:11:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 克莱尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hi, Claire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.65,1:11:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我过来就想跟你道个歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I just wanted to come and apologize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.49,1:11:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来没想把你卷进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I didn't want to bring you into any of this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.42,1:11:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但为了抓到那只迅猛龙只能这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}but it was the only way that we could get the raptor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.81,1:11:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We needed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.33,1:11:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,算了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.02,1:12:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}So, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.59,1:12:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你的目的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}This is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.12,1:12:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,像你这么聪明的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I mean, you're a smart guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.27,1:12:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,完全可以建个基金会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You could have started a foundation,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.14,1:12:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,专注于治愈癌症 而不是… 这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}cured cancer, but instead you... what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.12,1:12:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,贩卖濒危物种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Sell endangered species?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.52,1:12:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我救了这些动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I saved these animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.81,1:12:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你为了钱背叛了一个垂暮之人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You betrayed a dying man for money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.95,1:12:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔 我欣赏你的理想主义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Claire, I admire your idealism,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.24,1:12:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们都利用过这些动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}but we both exploited these animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.12,1:12:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,至少 我敢作敢当\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}At least I have the integrity to admit it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.07,1:12:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没做过任何违法的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I never, ever did anything remotely illegal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.52,1:12:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是你批准了暴虐霸王龙的研发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You authorized the creation of the Indominus rex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.44,1:12:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,为了赚钱 你把一个活生生的动物关在笼子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You exploited a living thing in a cage for money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.62,1:12:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我有什么区别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}How is that different? Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.32,1:12:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}And you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.60,1:12:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你证明了迅猛龙能够服从命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}The man who proved raptors can follow orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.09,1:12:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你就从来没想过把它们应用于实践吗 欧文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You never thought about the applications of your research, Owen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.08,1:12:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没想过一只训练有素的迅猛龙能卖几百万吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}How many millions a trained predator might be worth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.92,1:12:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩 是这个新世界的缔造者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You two, you're the parents of the new world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.80,1:12:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.69,1:12:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放开他 - 欧文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Let him go. - Owen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.32,1:12:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我要拧下他的手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I think I'll break it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.59,1:12:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,放开他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Let him go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.31,1:13:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔 我只想…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Claire, I just want... aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.15,1:13:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这两个人怎么处置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Say, how we gonna end this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.66,1:13:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,反正对其他人来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Well, as far as everybody else is concerned,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.95,1:13:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他们已经在岛上化成灰了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}they burned up on the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.60,1:13:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,买家们陆续到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Buyers on approach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.47,1:13:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚门庭若市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Looks like a full house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.35,1:13:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Roger that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.67,1:14:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Good evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.32,1:14:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好 晚上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Good evening. Good evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.46,1:14:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 欢迎光临 先生们 - 晚上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Welcome, gentlemen. Welcome. - Good evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.35,1:14:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他是里奇·拉斯洛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Ah, and these guys are development rep{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.29,1:14:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔达瑞斯制药公司的开发代表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}for Aldaris Pharmaceuticals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.47,1:14:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很好 - 留胡子的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Great. - And the guy in the beard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.96,1:14:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,格雷戈·阿德里奇的代理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}is a proxy for Gregor Adlrich,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.25,1:14:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那个斯洛文尼亚军火商\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}the Slovenian arms dealer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.24,1:14:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那位是兰德·马格努斯的代理人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Uh, equine buyers for Rand Magnus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.04,1:14:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他是来自休斯顿的石油大亨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}an oil magnate from Houston.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.17,1:14:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他们对什么恐龙感兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Well, what-what's their interest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.68,1:14:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的口味很独特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Strictly personal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.12,1:14:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他的孩子想要一只三角龙宝宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}His kid wants a baby triceratops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.32,1:14:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,格伦 詹妮特近来可好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Glenn, how's Janet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.03,1:14:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,她挺好的 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}She's doing fine, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.93,1:14:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,直走就行 格伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Straight ahead, Glenn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.88,1:15:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他们只想买两只食肉动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Well, he only wants carnivores. Two of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.22,1:15:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,洛克伍德先生今晚可以大赚一笔了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Looks like Lockwood's gonna have a very good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.35,1:15:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他会出席拍卖会吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Will he be joining us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.31,1:15:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不太可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Um, that's very unlikely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.76,1:15:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,外公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Grandpa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.64,1:15:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,外公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Grandpa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.06,1:15:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,外公 醒醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Grandpa, wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.51,1:15:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,外公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Grandpa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.10,1:15:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,外公 醒醒 快醒醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Grandpa, wake up. Wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.65,1:15:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Iris!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.27,1:15:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Iris!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.49,1:16:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,没救了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}It's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.29,1:16:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,太不幸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}What a tragedy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.80,1:16:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,既然他已经不在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I suppose now he's gone,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.23,1:16:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你也该另谋高就了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}you'll be looking for another situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.20,1:16:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.58,1:16:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,梅茜需要我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Maisie needs me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.96,1:16:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我是她的监护人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I'm her guardian now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.48,1:16:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,她需要什么就不劳你操心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}What she needs is no longer your concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.17,1:16:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,您不像我这么了解她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You don't understand her the way I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.85,1:16:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我了解她的价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I understand her value.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.37,1:16:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但她是我养大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}But I raised her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.70,1:16:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我养大了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I raised...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.20,1:16:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,她们俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}both of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.42,1:16:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 求您 米尔斯先生 - 再见 艾莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Please, Mr. Mills... - Good-bye, Iris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.20,1:17:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你还记得第一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Do you remember the first time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.72,1:17:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,见到恐龙的时候吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}you saw a dinosaur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.45,1:17:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次看到它们时 感觉就像…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}First time you see them, it's like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.20,1:17:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,见到了奇迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}a miracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.98,1:17:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你在书上看到过它们 在博物馆见过它们的骸骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You read about them in books, you see the bones in museums,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.97,1:17:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,但你心里并不完全相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}but you don't really believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.65,1:17:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,它们就像个神话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}They're like myths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.28,1:17:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,直到有天你看到了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}And then you see...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.01,1:17:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,第一只活着的恐龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}the first one alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.08,1:17:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}This is not your fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.58,1:18:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就是我的错 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- But it is. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.72,1:18:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}This one's on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.78,1:18:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是我指引了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I showed 'em the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.34,1:18:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Well, listen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.24,1:18:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们以后有的是时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}you and I are gonna have plenty of time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.64,1:18:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 争论谁对谁错 - 如果还有以后的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- to talk about this later. - If there is a later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.14,1:18:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,当然有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Yes, there is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.81,1:18:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我的小屋还没建好呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I got a cabin to finish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.38,1:18:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.69,1:18:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧谁醒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Well, look who just woke up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.44,1:18:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有办法出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We're getting out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.58,1:18:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Welcome...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.28,1:18:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}ladies, gentlemen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.68,1:19:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,在这美妙的夜晚相聚在此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}to this extraordinary evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.20,1:19:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们直奔主题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Let's dive right in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.08,1:19:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,请出一号拍品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}with lot number one...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.23,1:19:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,甲龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}the ankylosaurus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.13,1:19:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,她属于四足食草恐龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}She's a herbivorous quadruped,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.56,1:19:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 生活在白垩纪晚期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- I'll be damned! - late Cretaceous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.12,1:19:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这是最大的装甲恐龙之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}This is one of the largest armored dinosaurs,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.39,1:19:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,被古生物学家们誉为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}known by paleontologists{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.87,1:19:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,"活体坦克"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}as a living tank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.66,1:19:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.27,1:19:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,逃跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Escaping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.64,1:19:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你有把握吗 - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- You sure about this? - Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.24,1:19:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是四百万美元 有人出五百万吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I have $4 million. Anyone with five?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.08,1:19:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 五百万美元 - 五百万美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- $5 million. - $5 million.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.86,1:19:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,五百万 有人出六百万吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}$5 million. Do I hear six?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.79,1:19:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 六百万 - 六百万美元 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- $6 million! - $6 million. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.52,1:19:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,还有高于六… 七百万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Any increase on six... Seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.04,1:19:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 七百万 - 八百万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- $7 million. - $8 million, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.24,1:19:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,八百万美元 来电出价九百万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}$8 million. $9 million on the phones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.56,1:19:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,有人出一千万吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Do I hear $10 million?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.06,1:19:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一千万 一千万 - 一千万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- $10 million? $10 million? - Ten!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.63,1:19:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,一千万美元 一次 两次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}$10 million! Once, twice...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.71,1:20:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,成交 这位来自印度尼西亚的先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Sold... to the gentleman from Indonesia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.09,1:20:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜你 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Congratulations, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.47,1:20:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 下面请出二号拍品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Lot number two, ladies and gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.17,1:20:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,一只幼年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}A juvenile...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.53,1:20:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,易特龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}allosaurus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.94,1:20:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}A fierce...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.92,1:20:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,极其凶猛的食肉恐龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}and an aggressive predator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.09,1:20:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Sold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.63,1:20:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Sold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.05,1:20:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Sold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.86,1:20:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,真精彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Wonderful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.27,1:20:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,真是精彩的竞拍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Wonderful bidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.85,1:20:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 装好了 出发吧 - 出发吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- You're good. Let's go. - Move it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.05,1:20:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们走 - 装好货 出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Here we go. - Bring it on back. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.50,1:21:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.53,1:21:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey. Hey, you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.88,1:21:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我 看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Look at me. Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.49,1:21:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.62,1:21:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来 跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Come with me. Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.41,1:21:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 这就对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Okay. There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.26,1:21:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不用谢我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.33,1:21:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey! Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.97,1:21:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Please! Please wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.48,1:21:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,她是洛克伍德的外孙女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}That's Lockwood's granddaughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.02,1:21:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.79,1:21:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子 你想从那里下来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey, kid. You want to come down out of there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.54,1:22:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你还记得我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Do you remember me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.86,1:22:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫克莱尔 你叫什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}My name is Claire. What's yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.19,1:22:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,梅茜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Maisie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.85,1:22:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 梅茜·洛克伍德 - 梅茜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- Maisie Lockwood. - Oh, Maisie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.40,1:22:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我朋友 欧文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Well, this is my friend, Owen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.30,1:22:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我见过你跟迅猛龙在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I saw you with the velociraptors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.40,1:22:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,还有布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Uh, Blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.79,1:22:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Oh. Oh, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.61,1:22:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢恐龙吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Uh... y-you like dinosaurs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.91,1:22:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我也喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey, so do I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.23,1:22:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吧 你从那儿出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Tell you what, you come on down from there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.97,1:22:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你好好讲讲布鲁的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I'll tell you everything you need to know about Blue, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.93,1:22:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你看行吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}That sound all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.48,1:22:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}All right, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.89,1:22:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,出来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Come on down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.05,1:22:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Sweetie...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.84,1:22:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要你帮忙找到你的外公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}we need some help finding your grandfather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.94,1:22:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你能带我们去找他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Can you take us to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.39,1:22:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.81,1:22:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己一个人跑到这的 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You made it down here all by yourself, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.32,1:23:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,真勇敢 你需要有个朋友帮帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Brave kid. Looks like you could use a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.49,1:23:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他去世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}He's gone.{\r}
