Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.62,1:33:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你们觉得哈蒙德跟洛克伍德是怎么决裂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}What do you think drove Hammond and Lockwood apart? Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.01,1:33:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,洛克伍德压根就没有什么外孙女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Lockwood never had a grandchild.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.16,1:33:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他只想要复活他的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}He just wanted his daughter back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.76,1:33:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,当时他掌握了这项技术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}And he had the technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.77,1:33:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,于是他又造了一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}He created another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.24,1:34:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,让她再一次诞生于世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}He made her again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.52,1:34:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Go, go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.34,1:34:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.56,1:34:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.34,1:34:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,把这个送去给米尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Get this to Mills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.60,1:34:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,千万当心 这非常珍贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Be very careful... it's extremely valuable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.73,1:34:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你 我需要这迅猛龙的血液样本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You... I need blood samples from the raptor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.80,1:34:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,还愣在这干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Don't just stand there like an idiot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.38,1:34:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,快去给我50cc芬太尼和静脉采血工具来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Get me 50cc's carfentanil and a phlebotomy kit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.13,1:34:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,就在那边 快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}It's right there! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.79,1:34:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.44,1:34:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要这头迅猛龙的血样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I need this raptor's blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.16,1:34:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Oh! For God...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.72,1:34:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 请便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Sure, go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.79,1:34:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我要的东西呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Where is that kit?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.18,1:34:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Okay, now, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.88,1:34:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好还是乖乖配合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}It is better for you to cooperate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.56,1:34:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,但不管你帮不帮忙 这血样我都要定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I'm gonna get this blood, with or without your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.18,1:34:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,她的血已经不纯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}This blood's contaminated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.64,1:35:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这只动物是我亲自设计的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I designed this animal myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.36,1:35:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对是绝种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}It's pure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.79,1:35:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,她的每一个细胞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Every cell of her body{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.11,1:35:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,都是在最严格的环境中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}was created in the most controlled environment,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.30,1:35:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,最苛刻的条件下创造出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}under the most demanding of conditions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.01,1:35:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 但我用霸王龙给她输过血了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Yeah, but I did an intravenous blood transfusion with a T. rex,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.97,1:35:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,所以现在已经不纯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}So... it's a sock drawer in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.00,1:35:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你干了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.80,1:35:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,富兰克林 你在干吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Whoa! Frank! What are you doing?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.55,1:35:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我在救你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Saving your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.31,1:35:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.96,1:35:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.18,1:35:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.62,1:35:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,离那个笼子远一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Now, step away from that cage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.74,1:35:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.05,1:35:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Easy, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.04,1:36:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Run. Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.44,1:38:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,戴夫 收到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Dave, you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.81,1:38:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,戴夫 听到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Dave, you there?{\r}
