Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.18,1:39:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.62,1:39:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,氰化氢泄露\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}That's hydrogen cyanide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.19,1:39:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,如果超过控制等级所有恐龙都会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}If it reaches the containment level,it'll kill them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.72,1:39:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,通风系统出故障了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}The ventilation system is down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.47,1:39:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你能把它修好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Can you bring it back up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.14,1:40:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,服务器没有反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}The server's unresponsive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.53,1:40:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,必须重启整个系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I have to reboot the whole system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.05,1:40:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那就快重启 - 我在试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}- So reboot it. - I'm trying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.29,1:40:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.16,1:40:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,富兰克林 没时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Franklin, we don't have time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.28,1:40:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I know, I know, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.98,1:41:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.00,1:41:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Come on. Go! Go, run, run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.32,1:42:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.74,1:42:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.64,1:42:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,用手按住 别去看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Put pressure on it. Don't look at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.09,1:42:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我 看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Look at me. Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.47,1:42:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你得去找她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You have to go find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.68,1:42:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能把你留在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I can't leave you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.80,1:42:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧 我没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Go. I'll be fine.{\r}
