Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.85,1:45:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,梅茜 卧倒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Maisie! Stay down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.20,1:46:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Follow me.{\r}
