Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.71,1:46:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.35,1:46:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.36,1:46:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}This way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.83,1:47:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我抓住你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I got ya!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.38,1:47:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.49,1:49:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.50,1:49:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.88,1:49:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.24,1:49:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你们还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.55,1:49:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,挺好 你们呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Yeah. You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.19,1:49:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.58,1:50:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 下面出了点状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey, we got a problem downstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.40,1:50:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你们得下来看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I need you to come see this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.07,1:50:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,它们快死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}They're all dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.72,1:50:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,爆炸损坏了通风系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}The blast damaged the ventilation system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.07,1:50:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,能试的我们都试过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We did everything we could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.01,1:50:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以从这里打开闸门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I can open the gates from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.12,1:50:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔 想清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Claire. Be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.28,1:50:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在可不是在岛上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We're not on an island anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.02,1:51:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Claire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.39,1:51:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦按下去就再也不能回头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}You press that button, there is no going back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.56,1:51:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能看着它们死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We can't let them die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.50,1:52:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}I had to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.14,1:52:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,它们是有的生命 跟我一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}They're alive, like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.35,1:53:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.94,1:55:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 小妞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Hey, girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.38,1:55:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,欧文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Owen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.75,1:55:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 她不会伤害我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}It's okay. She won't hurt us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.61,1:55:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁 跟我来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Blue, come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.92,1:55:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们带你去一个安全的地方 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We'll take you to a safe place, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.66,1:56:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你们还要多少事例来证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}How many times do you have to see the evidence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.75,1:56:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话还要重复多少遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}How many times must the point be made?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.52,1:56:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这是在自取灭亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We're causing our own extinction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.82,1:56:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,跨越了太多不该跨越的界限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Too many red lines have been crossed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.02,1:56:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的家园 从根本上来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}And our home has,in fundamental ways,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.31,1:56:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,已经彻底被我们自身的贪婪和权欲所污染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}been polluted by avarice and political megalomania.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.69,1:57:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,基因力量好比潘多拉魔盒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Genetic power has now been unleashed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.31,1:57:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦开启必将带来灾难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}and of course, that's gonna be catastrophic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.32,1:57:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,从第一只再生恐龙诞生那刻起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}This change was inevitable from the moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.03,1:57:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这种改变已经不可避免\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}we brought the first dinosaur back from extinction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.74,1:57:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们总以为所谓的突变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We convince ourselves that sudden change{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.10,1:57:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是那些跳脱事物秩序的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}is something that happens outside the normal order of things,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.31,1:57:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,就像… 车祸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}like a... car crash,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.96,1:57:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,或者是超出我们控制的 就像绝症\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}or that it's beyond our control, like a fatal illness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.55,1:57:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们从未意识到如此不合常理的巨大改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We don't conceive of sudden, radical, irrational change{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.58,1:57:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,会发生在现实生活中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}as woven into the very fabric of existence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.39,1:57:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但我向各位保证 现实就是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Yet, I can assure you, it most assuredly is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.84,1:57:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,改变正在发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}And it's happening now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.84,1:57:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,人类和恐龙不得不设法共存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Humans and dinosaurs are now gonna be forced to coexist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.16,1:57:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这些生物的出现远早于我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}These creatures were here before us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:46.72,1:57:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们不谨慎对待 灭绝的将是我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}And if we're not careful, they're gonna be here after.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.40,1:57:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要学会适应这些超乎想象的威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We're gonna have to adjust to new threats that we can't imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.12,1:58:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,人类进入了一个新纪元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}We've entered a new era.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.14,1:58:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到侏罗纪世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H002C9FA9&}Welcome to Jurassic World.{\r}
